Expected delivery path

Diagram
flowchart TD
    A[Clarify fields roles permissions and acceptance criteria: several hours] --> B{Product owner scope approval if required}
    B --> C[Confirm data model security environment and release approach: several hours]
    C --> D{Architecture or security approval if required}
    D --> E[Implement application and role controls: 1 to 2 days]
    E --> F[Test functions permissions and failure cases: 0.5 to 1 day]
    F --> G{Acceptance approval by product owner or business users if required}
    G --> H{Deployment approval by release owner if required}
    H --> I[Deploy and perform smoke check: several hours]
    I --> J[Typical active effort: 2 to 5 working days; typically 1 to 2 weeks elapsed]

The workspace’s actual workflow, approval gates, and automation are not supplied, so these steps and approvals are typical rather than confirmed. Integrations, sensitive data, complex permissions, nonfunctional requirements, or scheduled reviews could extend the timeline.

